  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Rebuilt against TestFramework.Web 0.3.0 and TestFramework.Core 0.3.0. No API change in this package.\nInherited BREAKING change: teardown now deletes a SQL row located by WebExt.ArtifactFinder.Sql unless the declaring step chains MarkReadonly(). Rows found this way were previously left in place.\nIn container mode this is usually invisible: the SQL container this environment starts is removed when the run ends, so a deleted row inside it changes nothing observable. It matters when the same timeline runs against a database that outlives the run - a shared instance or a deployed environment. Add MarkReadonly() to discovery steps before doing that.",
